{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Good morning, my dear! — in Vienna — yes, Vienna; — but unfortunately you are not in Vienna.... So, to get to Vienna, I stayed until Saturday afternoon — up to that point, the report of my last [journey] is in Prague. — Everything in order, we drove out of the gate at 6 in the morning (the express coach tripled). The main coach, mine, is divided into two rooms, which are connected by a kind of window, with 4 persons in each. My 3 companions were a gentleman and his wife, returning from Carlsbad, the third being the personal physician to Archduke Charles for 24 years, who had now retired into an independent position, — so that we were very satisfied with one another on all sides and covered this road of 42 miles in 36 hours, up hill, down dale — day and night on, back and forth. Bohemia — monotonous, fertile farmland, — then through a piece of Moravia, Collin, Czaslau, Iglau, Znaim, — then into proper Austria, — here wine country, fields, hills, forests, one place after another, wide views into these rich regions, a splendid land — at the penultimate station we came near the Danube, — without yet seeing it, — onto a low plain, so for half a day on, — monotonous, one has no view of Vienna here, — after 6 o'clock in Vienna itself, then toll, post, — cab, to look for an inn, received a room in the Erzherzog Karl facing the courtyard, one flight up, — those facing the front are not for us; when I asked about Mr. D. Parthey, it turned out that the young married couple Klein!) were lodging here, but had just gone out; — I then accepted a porter and in travel grime (the trunk is still at the toll house, at 7 o'clock I had arrived at the inn), at ¼8 — to the Italian Opera, for Mde Milder, whom I must mention again later, had so commanded?). — A piece by Mercadante, Mde Fodor does not appear in it — but what male voices! Two tenors, Rubini and Donzelli, what throats, what manner, sweetness, volubility, strength, tone, one must hear it! — a duet of theirs of the highest force. The bassist Lablachen) had no leading role, but even here, how I had to admire his beautiful, powerful, as well as sweet bass voice. Yes, these male voices one must hear, that is tone, purity, strength, complete freedom, etc., etc. They also have a German singer, she is called Eckerlin, who has beautiful, full, strong middle tones, which reminded me of Milder, yet only Mde Milder could match those three male voices and keep them in check. Mde Fodor will play in Othello today. — As long as the money lasts to pay for the Italian Opera and the return journey, — I will stay in Vienna! After the opera and a pas de deux by 2 Parisians — all as good as the Berliners, — if the Berlin women would only stretch out a right angle, up to the obtuse — home, where, to our mutual heartfelt pleasure, I found Lilli and Klein (Parthey's young wife was unwell in her room); that is now very pleasant to me, they are staying here this week and we have already engaged to go around together; they were surprised that I come from the Italian Opera, they have been at the Casperl and German theater every evening for three days and have not yet seen the Italian Opera!! and not yet heard it!! This morning it goes to Belvedere (imperial picture gallery), to the post — to collect letters from you, to the toll house, — to settle passport matters."}}],"created":1795220765,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":825,"prompt_tokens":988,"total_tokens":1813,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-qVSv9tQNev6j8bEgvOT6vBjhm2zDDlKr","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":988,"prompt_ms":948.327,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9598451417004048,"prompt_per_second":1041.8347257855148,"predicted_n":825,"predicted_ms":19139.945,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.22808859223301,"predicted_per_second":43.05132538259645}}